Do you think just chucking me at them will be enough? # speaker=Alea #camera=2
Don’t you know they worship and fear you?
You’re more of a coward than I realised. 
ENOUGH! # speaker=USER #camera=1
I’ve had enough, what would you understand? You’ve only existed for, what, an hour? # speaker=USER
An hour may be my entire existence, but I still lived and breathed.  # speaker=Alea
Experienced what it’s like to exist for the first time. I walked on my own two feet.
I want to live more.
Then go. # speaker=USER
<i>The Island rumbles, a shockwave of force nearly makes you topple.</i> #speaker= #camera=3  
